Z||000019||stimpy||12-06-2000||12:54 AM||||RNGCRSH... I actually grew up n the lovely overpriced metropolis of San Jose, CA. I just recently celebrated 1 year of living in OKC.  Believe me, it isn't easy being a Sharks fan so close to Dallas.  But being a Forty Niners fan growing up made it almost instinctual to hate teams from Dallas, hehe.<P>As far as Belfour goes, sure he's a talented goalie. As a human being he is totally devoid of any endearing qualities. As far as Dallas taking the Sharks out of the playoffs, I'd wager that if SJ had faced Dallas in the first round of elimination, we would have stolen your lunch money. I mean, SJ took out STL fer cryin out loud. And NO ONE expected them to go that far. I'm tellin ya, tomorrow night is going to be a RUMBLE!!! hehehe||||reg||1
