Z||000030||bHooper||03-19-2001||10:51 AM||||OMG!  I cant believe that there was a hockey thread on the forum, and I missed it!<P>Ya ready for this one?.... I was born and raised in North Carolina, my parents are from here also, and I am a <B>HUGE</B> hockey nut!<P>It gets better... I am not a "Carolina Huricane's" fan (they still belong in Hartford)... I am a <B>Edmonton Oiler Nut!</B>  <P>Been a fan for 20 some years.  I grew up watching minor leauge hockey, the old Southern Hockey League (Slapshot was about a team that played in that league, and pretty acurate), then it was the ACHL, which became the ECHL.  Except for a 12 year void, we have had hockey in greensboro for over 40 years.  In that 12 years, we could go to Winston-Salem and watch the Thunderbirds.<P>Anyway, on to the point at hand... How about them Oilers???!!  They are hot right now!  I just hope they don't burn out b4 the playoffs, but I hope they get themselves in a position that they don't have to play Dallas again!  I am so tired of watching the stars...ever year!  Sure, those are always among the most exciting matchup's but it gets old.<P>GO OILERS!!!<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT<BR>KYB's, Eibach's,<BR>Poly Bushings||||reg||1
